{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y弱化了X中与具体音乐小节同步出现的细微变化，尤其是旋律起伏、音色转换和情绪尚未落定时的层次，音乐与文字的精细贴合度有所下降。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分工更适合边听边扫，叙述也更连贯地交代了从怕给对方负担、因对方没有退开而放松，到逐渐期待、害怕失去，最后决定不再隐藏心意的心理因果。X的重点高亮有助于迅速抓住每段核心，分时出现的感受也更细腻，尤其能呈现音乐内部的渐变和犹豫，但感受词过于密集，容易让观众忙于读取局部信息，反而不容易持续把握整段心理发展。综合普通观众的实际观看体验，我选Y，但X在音乐感受的精细度上确实有优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ddd76638-a3ff-43ff-ad34-186b1ce36f54", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T061650948881Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:18:07.968840+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c7ebb0c8aca3e0efdf8c93fab7588903159c2eb057d094ad718132c78dbfd7c0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "